":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-09T15:03:55Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T16:42:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122233","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122233","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122233.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122233.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nDuring light passes for canvas shaders, only the colour of the pixel prior to any light passes is passed to the developer (as the `COLOR` built-in. This PR also allows the developer to access the colour of the pixel with all previous light passes already applied (as the `ACCUMULATED_COLOR` built-in), allowing for more interesting lighting effects and for custom behaviour with lights interacting with each other. \r\n\r\nThis was not possible to do without modifying the internals as the GLES3 and RenderingDevice canvas shaders simply don't pass that data into the `light_compute` method so there would've been no way to access that information from inside a GDShader, and so modifying it was necessary.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nI'm fairly sure I've made all the edits to all files necessary to include the new built-in, but I'm not familiar with how to add it to the docs, and I would also appreciate someone more familiar with the graphics internals of Godot to check the code!","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122233/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}